       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose is above the safe limit.\n\n- **Ordered:** 2000 mg three times daily, which is 6,000 mg/day.\n- **Standard adult maximum:** 4,000 mg/day, usually given as 1,000 mg per dose. Many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day.\n- **This patient:** At 70 kg with normal liver and kidney function, they have no factor that would justify going above the maximum. A dose of 6,000 mg/day risks serious hepatotoxicity.\n\nHere are some options:\n1. **1,000 mg PO three times daily** (3,000 mg/day). This is a conservative standard order.\n2. **1,000 mg PO four times daily** (4,000 mg/day). This is the maximum, and it's usually given every 6 hours.\n3. **650 mg PO every 6 hours**, if you prefer a lower dose.\n\nIf 2000 mg was intended and I've misread it, for example if you meant a total daily dose, tell me and I'll enter it. Otherwise, tell me which option you want and I'll enter it right away."
